CODE

The source code in src/, scripts/, design/**/*.py, index.html and the project configuration files is released
under the MIT License below.

DESIGN AND IMAGERY

All rights reserved. Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel Pires.

This covers the ARC name and visual identity, the 3D model (design/arc-v4/arc.blend and arc.glb), every render
and frame in public/ and design/, and the screenshots in docs/screenshots/. You may view them here and on the
published site. You may not reuse, redistribute or adapt them without written permission.

The desk backdrop in the Why ARC setup image (design/why-arc/generated/) was made with ForgeGUI image generation
and is subject to ForgeGUI's terms; only the controller placed in it is an ARC render. The concept references in
design/arc-v2/ were also made with image generation.

Third-party packages installed through npm, and the Archivo typeface loaded from Google Fonts, keep their own
licences.

